  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,\r\n$(1+5 \\sqrt{2} x)^9+(1-5 \\sqrt{2} x)^9$\r\n$=2\\left\\{{ }^2 C_0+{ }^9 C_2(5 \\sqrt{2} x)^2+\\ldots+{ }^9 C_8(5 \\sqrt{2} x)^8\\right\\}$\r\nClearly, it has 5 terms."
